* {{sense|send (a letter) to}} to [[post]]
* {{sense|show (information, etc) in written form}} {{l|en|display}}, {{l|en|indicate}}, {{l|en|mark}}, {{l|en|show}}
* {{sense|computing: store (data)}} {{l|en|save}}, {{l|en|store}}
* {{sense|fill in, complete}} [[sit]] {{qualifier|Commonwealth}}
* See also [[Thesaurus:write]]

====Antonyms====
