yellow.content:
==English==
[[File:Color icon yellow.svg|thumb|Various shades of yellow]]
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/en:color}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|yeallow||obsolete}}
* {{alt|en|yeller||dialectal|or|pronunciation spelling}}
