#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Darryl Sterdan|title=ZAYN’s ‘Mind of Mine’ and Gwen Stefani’s ‘This is What the Truth Feels Like’ top this week’s new music|journal=The {{w|Toronto Star}}|date=2016-03-24|titleurl=http://www.torontosun.com/2016/03/24/zayns-mind-of-mine-and-gwen-stefanis-this-is-what-the-truth-feels-like-top-this-weeks-new-music
|passage=Both halves feature lyrics that are so teen-girly they sound like they were written in '''pink''' ink in a padlocked diary with hearts and frowny faces for punctuation.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20180617015214/http://torontosun.com/2016/03/24/zayns-mind-of-mine-and-gwen-stefanis-this-is-what-the-truth-feels-like-top-this-weeks-new-music/wcm/4836c6cf-adf8-4196-ab69-1db7f6c575e4}}
## {{U|magenta}}, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined.
## {{U|pale}} [[red]].
