##* {{quote-song|en|year=2023|author=Ennaria|title=Monstarrr|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cNB4ucAvJ8g|text=So go and tell your friends that I'm a fucking '''monster''' / Sugar, spice and torture / Do it for the culture}}
