===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|id=fruit|:inh|enm:appel<id:apple>|tree=1}}
{{multiple images
| total_width=200
| direction = vertical
| image1   = Red Apple.jpg
| caption1 = An apple ({{senseno|en|Q89}}).
