==Translingual==

===Etymology===
{{abbrev|mul|en:'''A'''n'''g'''al}} with {{m|mul|e}} as a placeholder, influenced by {{m|en|M'''e'''ndi}}.

===Symbol===
{{mul-symbol}}

# {{ISO 639|3}}

